  "prefLabel": "Plc 604.05 Challenging a Denial of Initial Licensure; Challenging License Conditions",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 604.05 Challenging a Denial of Initial Licensure; Challenging License Conditions. An applicant who wishes to challenge the denial of an application for initial apprentice licensure or who wishes to challenge any conditions included in the apprentice license shall do so as provided in Plc 304.10.\n\nSource. #14631, eff 9-21-26, EXPIRES: 9-21-36",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/plc600.html"
